{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01P3NVmi57anw8FSURbab9px","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\n2\t/**\n3\t * `beaufort.h' - libbeaufort\n4\t *\n5\t * copyright (c) 2014 joseph werle <joseph.werle@gmail.com>\n6\t */\n7\t\n8\t#ifndef BEAUFORT_H\n9\t#define BEAUFORT_H 1\n10\t\n11\t#if __GNUC__ >= 4\n12\t# define BEAUFORT_EXTERN __attribute__((visibility(\"default\")))\n13\t#else\n14\t# define BEAUFORT_EXTERN\n15\t#endif\n16\t\n17\t/**\n18\t * Default beaufort alphabet\n19\t */\n20\t\n21\t#ifndef BEAUFORT_ALPHA\n22\t#define BEAUFORT_ALPHA \\\n23\t  \"0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\"\n24\t#endif\n25\t\n26\t/**\n27\t * beaufort version\n28\t */\n29\t\n30\t#ifndef BEAUFORT_VERSION\n31\t#define BEAUFORT_VERSION \"1\" // default\n32\t#endif\n33\t\n34\t/**\n35\t * Encrypts plaintext using the beaufort\n36\t * cipher and an alphabet table if provided.\n37\t * The function will fallback to a table\n38\t * generated using the default alphabet\n39\t * defined by `BEAUFORT_ALPHA`.\n40\t */\n41\t\n42\tBEAUFORT_EXTERN char *\n43\tbeaufort_encrypt (const char *, const char *, char **);\n44\t\n45\t/**\n46\t * Decrypts plaintext using the beaufort\n47\t * cipher and an alphabet table if provided.\n48\t * The function will fallback to a table\n49\t * generated using the default alphabet\n50\t * defined by `BEAUFORT_ALPHA`.\n51\t */\n52\t\n53\tBEAUFORT_EXTERN char *\n54\tbeaufort_decrypt (const char *, const char *, char **);\n55\t\n56\t/**\n57\t * Constructs a tableau of rows\n58\t * and columns from a given alphabet\n59\t * using the following forumula to determine\n60\t * the row index in each column during creation:\n61\t * `(j + y) % size` where `size = strlen(alpha)`,\n62\t * `j = size - 1`, and * `y = y + 1`\n63\t */\n64\t\n65\tBEAUFORT_EXTERN char **\n66\tbeaufort_tableau (const char *);\n67\t\n68\t#endif\n69\t\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d1b2a0f-b1c5-426d-b3b1-505ab83f7813","uuid